      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅希亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2037_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......现在应该只差一场安抚人心的听证会了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4151_tinman_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也在疑惑听证会的时间安排，对吗？"
